cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use DFMethods.jl in your research, please cite it as below."
title: "DFMethods.jl: A configurable framework for derivative-free projection methods for constrained nonlinear equations"
abstract: "DFMethods.jl provides a configurable framework for derivative-free projection methods for solving constrained nonlinear equations F(x) = 0 over closed convex feasibility sets, integrated with NonlinearSolve.jl. Components — search direction, line search, iterate-update strategy, inertial rule, constraint set, stopping criteria, and callbacks — are independently pluggable."
type: software
